meta {
  name: supervision
}

docs {
  TRZ-29, TRZ-32 and TRZ-35 against a running API with the synthetic fixture and
  DEMO_MODE=true, on a freshly seeded database, with ANALYST_DEMO_PASSWORD in bruno/.env.
  The customer is Pasaporte SYN0000007 (Mexico), who has no clarification in the other folders.
  With the seed of the policy (20260934) draws 1 and 2 are selected, so the first registration
  of the stack, and the second, are audit samples: run this folder before any other folder that
  registers more than one dispute.
  01 to 03: customer and analyst sessions.
  04 to 08: the customer registers a charge with its button; the case is drawn and enters the
  queue as an audit sample with rho 0.10, and the dossier shows the draw (TRZ-29).
  09 to 13: an audit cannot be asked about (409); a reversal moves the clarification to review,
  and the customer gets one unread notification, read once; an analyst has none (TRZ-32).
  14 to 21: the switch starts off; an invalid body is 422 and a customer gets 403; with it on,
  the next charge goes to the queue with escalate.automation_disabled; it goes back off (TRZ-35).
}
